---
layout: base.njk
title: "Blog"
description: "Engineering posts on unlimited modular routing, mathematically proven DSP, granular synthesis, and Perception's hardware synth factory."
---

<section class="section grid-backdrop">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot dot-signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>Perception Blog</p>
      <h1>Routing, DSP proofs &amp; hardware</h1>
      <p>Notes from building a transparent modular synth studio, VST3 plug-in, and hardware factory.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in site.posts %}
      <a class="blog-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <div class="blog-cover">
          <img src="{{ post.image }}" alt="{{ post.alt }}" {% if loop.first %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %} decoding="async">
        </div>
        <div class="blog-body">
          <div class="blog-meta">
            <span class="card-tag">{{ post.tag }}</span>
            <span>{{ post.date }}</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>{{ post.readTime }}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{{ post.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.summary }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
